1790667836.037	
1790667836.037	The story of the printing press is a sprawling epic that spans continents and millennia, evolving from rudimentary woodblock techniques to complex mechanical marvels powered by steam and electricity. It is a narrative intertwined with religion, revolution, science, commerce, and democracy itself. To trace its history is not just to document mechanics; it is to map the trajectory of modern thought.
